0 // Studless rims and their tyres. Each rim's seat is the band its tyre's bead sits in,
0 // measured from the LDraw shapes, its radius where the tyre's inside meets the rim; every
0 // axis runs along z. Which tyre goes on which rim is from how the official models in the
0 // LDraw Official Model Repository mount them.

